# Paste the address you got when you deployed contracts/watchtower.py
# in GenLayer Studio. Copy this file to .env.local and fill it in --
# .env.local is gitignored on purpose, so your own deploy address
# never gets committed.
#
# The current audit-remediated contract is already live on studionet at
# 0x3C318Cb7cC02E3d5D5abB08CeDA8b58Ba3f05b4b, and that address is also
# baked into lib/contract.ts as the default, so the app works even if this
# is left blank. Only set this to override with a different deployment.
NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTRACT_ADDRESS=
